  "title": "EEG frequency tagging reveals the integration of dissimilar observed actions",
  "description": "This dataset contains EEG recordings from a frequency-tagging study investigating how the brain integrates observed actions that are visually or semantically dissimilar. Participants viewed action stimuli tagged at distinct frequencies while neural responses were recorded to examine integration effects in the frequency domain. The data are organized according to the BIDS-EEG standard.",
